# Explicit sequential-frontend subset fixture, never fitted Iris timing.
purpose uncalibrated-integration-fixture
source source-Shuttle-RVC-EX-MEM-COM-WB-sequential-frontend-fixture
shuttle_pipeline pure-integer-rvc-sequential-frontend
base_hz 100000000
rtc_divider 200
max_cycles 100000000
trap_cycles 4
hart 0 1 1
hart 1 1 1
hart 2 2 1
resource scalar0 1
resource scalar1 1
resource scalar2 1
rule 0 0 0 scalar0 3 1 serialized-boundary base_cycles
rule 1 0 0 scalar1 3 1 serialized-boundary base_cycles
rule 2 0 0 scalar2 3 1 Rocket-fixture base_cycles
